#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0437 expect=violation domain=AE
#note "PLAN-per-row-functions phase 0 (first scenario for CDISC-CG0437): AESOCCD=1234567 on row 2 is not a System Organ Class code of the (dummy) MedDRA dictionary at the SOCCD level -> fires. Row 1 carries a valid SOCCD (10029205); row 3's missing AESOCCD is a completeness concern of another rule -> no fire (a blank is valid). Executing pin written against the pre-port engine."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#dictionaries dummy
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=2 AESEQ=2 AESOCCD=1234567
dataset AE class=EVENTS
col USUBJID type=Char
col AESEQ   type=Num
col AEDECOD type=Char
col AESOCCD type=Num
---
001 | 1 | Headache | 10029205
001 | 2 | Nausea   | 1234567
002 | 1 | Headache | .
